    // progression a single clean anchor, so next session prescribes one coherent weight instead of a
    // ladder. Only working sets are touched (warm-ups and drop/myo sub-sets are left as-is).
    // Level all working sets to the top working set's WEIGHT, and prefill the logged reps to what you
